'''Storm Star''' is the upgraded form of [[Flametal Mace]] using the [[Iolite]]. Like all upgraded-weapons that use [[Iolite]], they gain 10 [[Lightning|lightning damage]] and their hit effect has a 25% chance to apply [[Chain Lightning]].

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* The slower secondary attack deals 2.5x damage and 2x staggering.

An upgraded Flametal Mace will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Storm Star.

